cff-version: 1.2.0
title: cellstate
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the version and the scientific model backend you used. No
  biological backend is registered and no benchmark is scientifically admitted; cite this software
  as infrastructure and a specification, not as a validated cell-state model.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  A system for computing a faithful and accurate representation of hidden cellular state: a
  query-conditioned posterior over causally relevant cell state, together with the predictive
  sufficiency and calibration evidence required to establish that the posterior is faithful.
repository-code: "https://github.com/logannye/cellstate"
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - virtual-cell
  - state-estimation
  - predictive-sufficiency
  - bayesian-filtering
authors:
  - given-names: Logan
    family-names: Nye
